		prior: "A blank must not become 0. A very large point must not become trash without a look.",
		see: "One point stands apart. It might be a festival week, or it might be a typo.",
		plain: "A far point is a flag. A flag is not a verdict.",
		situation: "Example: most weeks are under 40 forms, one week is 120. An IQR fence only marks that point. At Tết, 120 can be real. An extra zero, and 120 can be a typo.",
