		precise: "The session S3 Graded Questions in Retrieval Augmented Generation with LlamaIndex is not turned into questions or click-steps in the notebook. If you need to do the work, reopen the ideas in the teaching part of the same course. There is no answer here.",
		insight: "A drill is not a second idea.",
